# Toluca Lake and the Lakeview Hotel to the 312 videotape, on foot in the PC's order: 1F (map, 312
# key, the Fish key, Laura at the piano), the thinner in BF, 2F (the 204 key, the photo and the trunk,
# Cinderella), the employee elevator down to the 1F west wing (stage 41 event 13 on flag 21), the
# employee map, the videotape and the can opener, Snow White, BF's light bulb and bar key, the music
# box, the stairway key, 3F and room 312
debughud 1
pt fast 1
pt walkmode 1
pt load w08
pt god 1
pt noenemies 1
pt ev 2
pt until stage 38 30
# James rows (boat.c): 381 once the boat is at the hotel pier. The driver does not row: the
# crossing is the one step it moves James (the boat comes with him) instead of walking
pt walkmode 0
pt ev 3
pt walkmode 1
pt idle
pt expect flag 381 1
pt ev 4
pt expect item 67 1
pt ev 5
pt expect stage 40
